                      0.311, LOAD = 0.079), shifting the focus to dynamic circuits.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <strong>Greedy suppressor blind spot:</strong> greedy JCCS deflation misses
                      suppressive heads (two NIAH suppressors found via joint ablation).
                    </li>
                    <li>
